  "prefLabel": "Plc 1607.01 Rules of Practice and Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1607.01 Rules of Practice and Procedure.\n\n(a) The rules in Plc 200 and Plc 310 shall govern:\n\n(1) The receipt of misconduct complaints and the investigation thereof; and\n\n(2) The conduct of disciplinary hearings.\n\n(b) The rules in Plc 200 shall govern:\n\n(1) The conduct of all other adjudicative and non-adjudicative proceedings;\n\n(2) Waivers of rules;\n\n(3) Voluntary surrender of licenses; and\n\n(4) Any other procedures not included in this chapter.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
